    "en": "Pakistan project cycle: development, execution, completion"
  },
  "description_key": "governance.catalogue.pakistan_pk.description",
  "description_labels": {
    "en": "Three phases and two gates as an employer in Pakistan runs a works contract: development (PC-I or the owner's brief, design, building plan approval and NOCs, PPRA tender and award), execution under the contract (interim payment certificates, measurement book, variations) and completion (taking-over, defects liability and the PC-IV completion report). The ten management areas and the frame documents are those of the neutral PrimeCrest model."
  },
  "source_url": null,
  "source_title": "PrimeCrest Pakistan pack (Spyder Solutions). Phases after the Planning Commission project cycle (PC-I to PC-IV) and the PEC standard bidding documents; areas and documents from the PrimeCrest neutral model.",
